  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- **Set your own indicator periods.** The Indicators dialog (`i` on a chart) lists each indicator by its full name and period, and `p` changes the period of a checked SMA, EMA, Bollinger Bands or RSI to any whole number from 2 to 500. (#1102)\n- **Global installs stop slowing down over time.** An install from `bun install -g gloomberb` recorded a timing entry for every render and never freed it, so it grew heavier the longer it ran. Thanks @Harshil-Jani. (#1101)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.15.1...v0.15.2)\n",
